    "name": "QueryResultModelHandler<TArg, TModel> model-mapping callback",
    "kind": "Library",
    "language": "csharp",
    "contract": "A caller supplies this callback to map one executed query result for a shard into a TModel value. The callback receives the model instance, the short shard identifier, stored-procedure name, optional TArg argument, DbDataReader, DbParameterCollection, connection description, and logger; it returns the resulting TModel."
